  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "fcrepo-camel uses jena classes for handling RDF in the org.fcrepo.camel.processor classes. Those should be swapped out for the corresponding clerezza libraries (",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "http://clerezza.apache.org/),"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "http://clerezza.apache.org/),",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " which wrap jena-core in an OSGi-safe way. It is possible to deploy fcrepo-camel without the change, but it would be significantly easier if its dependency chain was fully OSGi compliant – which would make the pom.xml configuration much cleaner.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1
  },
  "duedate": null,
  "environment": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Karaf 3.0 and other OSGi containers",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
   ],
